742 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 165 0 R
/T (The Handwritten Digit Recognition project demonstrates how artificial intelligence and neural networks can be used to classify images. The MNIST dataset provides labeled grayscale images for ten digit categories, allowing the complete machine-learning workflow to be implemented without collecting a custom dataset. )
