/Title (Handwritten Digit Recognition is an application of Artificial Intelligence \(AI\) and Machine Learning \(ML\) in which a computer identifies a numerical digit from an image. Human handwriting differs in size, shape, slant, and writing style, so recognizing digits automatically is a useful image-classification task.)
